    story: Ana Voidwhisper was born in a monk refuge, where silence, breath, and
      repeated chores were treated as survival tools. As a child, Ana Voidwhisper
      lived through a valley watch duty, learning caution, secrecy, and suspicion
      of outsiders. As a young adult, Ana Voidwhisper worked through the outlaw camp
      years, learning ambushes, bad roads, guilt, and the cost of trusting desperate
      people. They enter the dojo to buy distance from old crimes.
